# Top-level directories of the in-repository Rust kernel and the SwiftUI and Tauri clients,
# which this tree no longer has. Checkouts that switch here from an older branch keep their
# ignored build state (cargo targets, SwiftPM and node_modules directories) on disk; these
# entries keep it out of git status. Nothing in this tree may be added below them.
